WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.180
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:12.840
The reading from the Srinaksadion for June 24, on which we commemorate the Nativity

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:19.850
of the Holy and Glorious Prophet, Forerunner and Baptist, John.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.010
On the 24th of the month we celebrate the Nativity of the venerable and Glorious Prophet

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:29.210
and Forerunner, John the Baptist.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:36.170
As soon as the Archangel Gabriel had left the most holy Mother of God, after having announced

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.650
the good news of her virginal childbearing and having referred to her cousin Elizabeth's

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:48.770
pregnancy as a confirmation of his words, Mary went with haste to the village in Judea

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.570
where Zachariah and Elizabeth lived.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:59.010
She greeted her cousin and immediately the six-month fetus in Elizabeth's womb leapt

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:06.170
for joy, making himself the Savior's Forerunner even before his birth.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:13.330
Elizabeth lent her own voice to the Prophet and cried aloud, Blessed are Thou among women,

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:16.570
and Blessed is the fruit of thy womb.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:23.290
And once is this to me, that the Mother of my Lord should come to me.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:31.250
Mary replied with her wondrous canticle of thanksgiving, My soul doth magnify the Lord.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:37.490
She remained with Elizabeth for three months, giving her practical help, and talking with

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.290
her about God's wonderful acts.

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.090
Then, she returned home.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:50.130
When the time arrived or Elizabeth to give birth, she brought a son into the world who was

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:55.770
welcomed with joy and gladness by his family and all the neighbors.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:02:02.050
On the eighth day, when they circumcised the child, they wished to name him after Zachariah

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:05.370
his father, as was the custom.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:11.730
But Elizabeth spoke up and said quite categorically, Not so.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:15.850
He shall be called John.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:21.730
Those who were present objected that no one in their family had ever been called John,

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:28.050
and turning to Zachariah, they asked for his opinion, for he had remained deaf and dumb

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:32.370
since the time that the Archangel Gabriel had visited him.

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:40.450
Zachariah asked for a writing tablet and wrote, His name is John.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:46.490
At that very moment, he was delivered from his dumbness and filled with a Holy Spirit,

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:51.970
and began to prophesy and to address this hymn to God.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:58.690
Blessed be the Lord, the God of Israel, for he has visited and redeemed his people, and

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:05.010
hath raised up a mighty Savior for us in the house of his servant David, as he promised

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:11.050
by the mouths of his holy prophets, who have been since the world began.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:17.450
And thou, child, thou shalt be called the prophet of the most high, for thou shalt go before

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:24.090
the face of the Lord to prepare his ways to give knowledge of salvation to his people by

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:28.090
the forgiveness of their sins.

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:34.610
He who was born contrary to all expectation from a barren womb, brought forth a spiritual

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:41.050
springtime by his birth, proclaiming that the Messiah, whose way he was preparing, would

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:49.450
come to renew the laws of human nature and to open to humankind the path to deification.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:56.290
He who was called by God to become the voice of the Word, freed his Father's tongue, which

00:03:56.290 --> 00:04:02.850
had been made captive by his lack of faith, and put an end to the figures and shadows of

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.130
the Old Covenant.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:11.730
The last of the prophets, John, according to the words of the Lord, is the greatest of all

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:18.610
those born of woman, and is also the first of the apostles.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:24.450
Being born on that day, he began to shine in the world as the flaming torch of the true

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:31.650
light, as the star proclaiming the sun of righteousness, and as the herald announcing the appearing

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:39.900
of the Word, fear and wonder took hold of all who were present, and the news spread throughout

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.540
the whole of Judea.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:49.460
The child grew and his spirit became strong, for the hand of the Lord was upon him.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:56.540
As soon as he was weaned and able to walk, he left the family home, and went to live in

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:02.980
the desert, where dressed in camel skin and wearing a leather belt around his loins,

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:06.820
he fed on locusts and wild honey.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:14.380
This man of whom the world was unworthy lived there a life without anxiety or sadness, delivered

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:21.020
from the passions and assaults of desire, contemplating God in his heart, and making him his delight

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.340
and consolation.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:30.900
Other prophets before him had certainly lived in the desert, for example Moses and Elias,

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:38.500
but John, living in the desert as if in heaven, was superior to these, and manifested by his

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:45.380
retreat the renewal of human nature, of which he had been made the forerunner, and inaugurated

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:51.980
for humankind the possibility of living like angels while in the flesh.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:57.820
Overginity, Askeesys, and contemplation.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:03.120
He led this angelic life in the desert until the fifteenth year of the reign of Tiberius

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:09.940
Caesar, when the word of God came to him, ordering him to return to the inhabited parts of

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:17.180
the region, in order to proclaim the coming of the Lord to prepare his ways, by exhorting

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:24.380
the people to repent and be baptized in the Jordan for the remission of their sins.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:29.700
As all were asking themselves if John might be the Messiah for whom Israel was waiting, he

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:39.020
answered them, saying, I indeed baptize you with water, but one mightier than I comeeth.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:44.020
The latchet of whose shoes I am not worthy to unloose.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:50.540
He shall baptize you with the Holy Spirit and with fire.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:55.780
With many others such exhortations, he proclaimed to the people the good news of salvation in

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.580
Christ Jesus our Lord.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:04.020
Although all the prophecies of St. John the Baptist have found their fulfillment, his message

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.140
remains of permanent value for the church.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:12.660
He will not cease to be the forerunner until the end of time, proclaiming to all who wish

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:19.660
to welcome the Savior, that is by repentance, the cutting off of worldly pleasures, retreat

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:27.300
and prayer, that they may prepare in themselves the way by which Christ will make his entry

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:33.020
in the power of the Holy Spirit.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:39.260
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's, O Lord Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.260
and save us.
